From: AroioOS
Subject: [PATCH] src: do not pass -static to every compile and link

"-static" in AM_CFLAGS also reaches the link of bluealsad, which then needs
static versions of all libraries (dbus-1, asound ...). Systems with shared
libraries only (Buildroot) cannot link it. libbluealsad is a noinst
convenience library and static anyway.

---
--- a/src/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/Makefile.am
@@ -171,8 +171,7 @@
 	@MPG123_CFLAGS@ \
 	@OPUS_CFLAGS@ \
 	@SBC_CFLAGS@ \
-	@SPANDSP_CFLAGS@ \
-	-static
+	@SPANDSP_CFLAGS@
 
 libbluealsad_la_LIBADD = \
 	shared/libshared.la \
